  "text": "Board Of Elections | Northampton County, NC\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account\n- Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nGovernment\nDepartments\nCommunity\nHow Do I...\nAbsentee by Mail Voting\nMilitary & Overseas Absentee Voting\nEarly Voting Hours & Locations (PDF)\nRegister to Vote (PDF)\nState Board of Elections\nVoter LookUp\nHome\nGovernment\nBoards & Committees\nBoard Of Elections\nBoard Of Elections\nOverview\nThe board of elections is responsible for conducting fair and impartial elections according to the guidelines established by the general statutes of the state of North Carolina. The board of elections maintains voter registration records and encourages the participation of all eligible voters in the election process.\nElection Law Updates\nChanges affecting the administration of elections in North Carolina will be shared below and updated as required.\nPhoto ID Now Required\nPhoto ID Now Required to Vote in NC\nVoter Photo ID Information (PDF)\nNC State Board of Elections-Voter ID\nVoter Eligibility Update\nWere you included on the list of voters listed as not having an identification number on your voter registration record?\nClick\nhere\nto check and find out what to do to correct it.\nVoter Eligibility for People Serving Felony Sentences\nUpcoming Election Information\nNovember 3, 2026 Mid-Term General Elections\nEarly Voting Plan November 3, 2026\nEarly Voting Roster_revised\nSample Ballot - November 3, 2026 General Election\nUOCAVA Notice Nov. 3, 2026\nElection Schedule-2026\nCommittee Campaign Forms (PDF)\nImportant Information\n2025-2027 Precinct Official Appointments\nPrecinct Official Appointments\nNorthampton County Polling Places\nBuffer Zones for Northampton County\nNorthampton Co. Elected Officials\nJoin us on Facebook\nSpinosa G. Clements\nElections Director\nEmail Spinosa G. Clements\nShirley Everest\nChair (R)\nEmail Shirley Everest\nMyron Grueneich\nSecretary (R)\nEmail Myron Grueneich\nVivian Branch\nMember (D)\nEmail Vivian Branch\nLynne Kinyon\nMember (R)\nEmail Lynne Kinyon\nEugene Taylor\nMember (D)\nEmail Eugene Taylor\nTussie Phillips\nDeputy Director\nEmail Tussie Phillips\nValerie Hinton\nElections Office Assistant\nEmail Valerie Hinton\nBoard Of Elections\nPhysical Address\n9495 NC Highway 305\nJackson\n,\nNC\n27845\nPhone:\n252-534-5681\nFax: 252-509-0092\nUpcoming Events\nTue, Oct. 20\nAbsentee Meeting\nTue, Oct. 27\nAbsentee Meeting\nMon, Nov. 2\nAbsentee Meeting\nView All Events\n/Calendar.aspx\nMeetings\n10 a.m. the 2nd Tuesday of every month; additional meetings will be properly noticed\nPlease join meetings from your\ncomputer, tablet, or smartphone\nAccess Code: 187-926-669\nGet the app now and be ready when your first meeting starts\nYou can also dial in using your phone by calling +1 312-757-3121\nAgendas & Minutes\nAlerts\nEmployment Opportunities\nGIS Maps\nOnline Payment\nReport a Concern\nContact Us\n126 E. Jefferson St.\nJackson, NC 27845\nSocials\nFacebook\nX\nInstagram\nYouTube\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nQuick Links\nAgendas & Minutes\nCounty Manager\nRegister of Deeds\nPublic Works\nSheriff Office\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nEmployee Portal\nAccessibility\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus\u00ae\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
